SIG — LICENCE POSTURE (PLACEHOLDER)
===================================

SPDX-License-Identifier: LicenseRef-SIG-Undetermined

This repository's final licensing has NOT yet been decided. The licensing
decision is owned by ticket P00.2 and by the canonical design spec
(docs/2_canonical_design_spec.md §42, "Licensing Decision"), which anticipates a
split posture — for example an open-data licence (ODbL) for database contents
and a separate open-source licence for code, with per-source rights computed at
export time.

Until P00.2 lands:

  * Treat all code and data in this repository as UNDETERMINED for
    redistribution purposes.
  * Every source file carries the SPDX tag `LicenseRef-SIG-Undetermined` as a
    placeholder. P00.2 replaces both this file and those tags with the resolved
    licence identifiers.

This placeholder exists so that the repository has an explicit, machine-readable
licence posture from its first commit, rather than an implicit "all rights
reserved" silence.
